  "description": "XUTBIB crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P b c n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H120 N16 O48 Tb8. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb6 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb7 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb8 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.775-3.843 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.66-111.96°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C84H120N16O48Tb8. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
